Para instalar, execute:
```
export GH_ACCOUNT={{GH_ACCOUNT}}
export GH_BRANCH={{GH_BRANCH}}
export INSTALL_URL=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/{{GH_ACCOUNT}}/refs/heads/{{GH_BRANCH}}/install.sh
curl -s $INSTALL_URL | sudo env INSTALL_URL="$INSTALL_URL" bash
```

Para depurar a instalação, adicione `-x` após o comando bash.
